>5. What was the name of that wizard who was always trying to catch Smurfs?
>   What was his cats name?  'Frobozz' is getting old for a character name,
>   and my cat Milo is wondering why I always curse him while I'm sitting at
>   the big table with the funny box on it (especially when he keeps eating
>   that tasty floating eye).

To prevent your pet from eating your killings, you may want to let your pet
kill it, especially if it's a harmless one like a floating eye.  When your
pet has used up its turn killing the monster, then you're free to step in
and pick it up or eat it.  Just be sure that you are standing right next to
the monster when your pet kills it.
